	(text "J5: bring-up header. AUX_IO0-4 are spare FPGA bank-13 pins (LVCMOS33)\nthat also run to the spare inter-board pins J2.42/44/46/47/48.\nAUX_IO3/IO4 pair with TCXO_CLK/PDM_CLK: keep them slow or inputs."
